<title>INDIA: India 96/97 rice exports seen at 2.5 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>India 96/97 rice exports seen at 2.5 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's rice exports in 1996/97 (April-March) are expected to fall to 2.5 million tonnes from 5.0 million in the previous fiscal year, the All India Rice Exporters Association (AIREA) said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>&quot;As compared to last year, India hopes to achieve a maximum export target of around 2.5 million tonnes in 1996/97,&quot; AIREA said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;World trade has gone down by two million tonnes this year so India also has to face a share,&quot; AIREA executive director Anil Adlakha told reporters.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
